<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP FIRST DAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP FIRST DAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first</p>
<p>day of English county championship matches on Friday:</p>
<p>At Derby: Derbyshire 408-9 (P.DeFreitas 96, K.Barnett 86,</p>
<p>K.Krikken 72) v Lancashire</p>
<p>Portsmouth: Yorkshire 389-6 (D.Lehmann 182, M.Vaughan 74) v</p>
<p>Hampshire</p>
<p>Lord's:  Middlesex 205 (M.Gatting 54; Saqlain Mushtaq 5-50),</p>
<p>Surrey 123-2 (M.Butcher 56 not out)</p>
<p>Trent Bridge: Somerset 290-6 (M.Burns 72, P.Holloway 72;</p>
<p>A.Oram 4-53) v Nottinghamshire</p>
<p>Hove: Gloucestershire 291-8 (R.Dawson 98) v Sussex</p>
<p>Worcester: Worcestershire 342-4 (T.Curtis 160, G.Hick 65) v</p>
<p>Glamorgan</p>
